      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9d3a47ed4e8f9d10f4606af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白家有被评为长途跑者的赛马娘，\n目白麦昆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f7431fdb10617efcc5f124e0a33691098469c4753b47ffdfe69755c92ad9eb8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3f132a897c4ec19f49b697f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以及跑起步来强而有力的目白赖恩等，\n许多前途无量的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6de298c2c245112fee5c32bfb69970015b8437e4919e05ce57a50a85058d0456",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018200.json",
      "json_path": [
