      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而目白多伯也跟她们一样，\n同是备受大家期待的一位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "735ed2914662d0c22007a5182b7748b2adf4ee5dfe2bb001e98b13b218c55a30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
